      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">Which Platform Should You Choose?</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">If you are an Indian D2C brand selling through Amazon India, Nykaa, Flipkart, or your own website — <strong>AnalyzeG</strong> is purpose-built for you. Verified video intelligence, Power BI dashboards, raw data you own, and ad licensing for your own products.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:2rem;">If you sell through US/EU retail and need syndication — choose Bazaarvoice or PowerReviews. If you are on Shopify and need an all-in-one suite — choose Yotpo. If you just need company-level trust badges — choose Trustpilot.</p>
